  "primaryWitnesses": [
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-4-13",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI04.htm#V13",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 4:13",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Ben Geber, in Ramoth Gilead (the towns of Jair the son of Manasseh, which are in Gilead, belonged to him; and the region of Argob, which is in Bashan, sixty great cities with walls and bronze bars, belonged to him);",
      "textSHA256": "dbe4dca809e47876f2c2ba3763348eadf75d4ec84e1895a6e39e3f35f00a4bf9"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-3",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V3",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:3",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "The king of Israel said to his servants, “You know that Ramoth Gilead is ours, and we do nothing, and don’t take it out of the hand of the king of Syria?”",
      "textSHA256": "33ec6d0042ef332083f2fbb003bb049acbeb192820ca31cc4eea4201ad81428f"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-4",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V4",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:4",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "He said to Jehoshaphat, “Will you go with me to battle to Ramoth Gilead?” Jehoshaphat said to the king of Israel, “I am as you are, my people as your people, my horses as your horses.”",
      "textSHA256": "160295144ab2dcfcc856d7e79d00d876b34cc7df1ffb4a6ff4625d9478c4b51a"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-6",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V6",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:6",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Then the king of Israel gathered the prophets together, about four hundred men, and said to them, “Should I go against Ramoth Gilead to battle, or should I refrain?” They said, “Go up; for the Lord will deliver it into the hand of the king.”",
      "textSHA256": "db12b6eb983be3a6b4b9d010a0300a20a1a58240df6fdc12ca0d54284a34d9a0"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-12",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V12",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:12",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "All the prophets prophesied so, saying, “Go up to Ramoth Gilead and prosper; for the LORD will deliver it into the hand of the king.”",
      "textSHA256": "835efc727bc3cb9d32dee8c4f959a6376441f3b04bfaf45ed9d35029d0d9250f"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-15",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V15",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:15",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "When he had come to the king, the king said to him, “Micaiah, shall we go to Ramoth Gilead to battle, or shall we forbear?” He answered him, “Go up and prosper; and the LORD will deliver it into the hand of the king.”",
      "textSHA256": "a9506ebfebc081ca7a998a859d37f730c01cc0e8d83f2ad0e581a3c5523515db"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-20",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V20",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:20",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "The LORD said, ‘Who will entice Ahab, that he may go up and fall at Ramoth Gilead?’ One said one thing, and another said another.",
      "textSHA256": "eef4d97a9dd112c4407105efac194d9476944cb319d55d1b58282539a71b03e6"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-22-29",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1KI22.htm#V29",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 22:29",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "So the king of Israel and Jehoshaphat the king of Judah went up to Ramoth Gilead.",
      "textSHA256": "dbb8bd839dcc01cacab1f4a73ac498665fd023c94c5798b50ba65c4f030d343e"
    }
  ],
